Evolution of Cumulative Surface Waters over I.R. of Pakistan (26 to 30 April 2023) Vs. (16 to 20 June 2023)   
- Between 16 to 20 June 2023 approximately 3 million people are potentially exposed or living close to maximum floodwaters areas(*);  
- Approximately 468,000 people are potentially exposed or living close to minimum floodwaters areas(**) between 16 to 20 June 2023;  
- Based on satellite observations between 16 to 20 June 2023 and compared with observations between 26 to 30 April 2023, the maximum flood water extent appears to increase approximately ~ 2,000 km² in Sindh and ~ 3,500 km² in Punjab.
